        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious Detached Family Residence on Mature Grounds of approximately 0.75 acre.\nLocated in a peaceful and highly convenient residential setting, St Martins is a substantial detached family home offering an exceptional balance of space, comfort and flexibility, making it an ideal choice for growing families seeking a home that can adapt to their changing needs.\nBuilt in 1987 and extending to generous proportions throughout, the property has been thoughtfully enhanced over the years to include a wonderful sunroom extension, perfectly positioned to capture the desirable south-west facing aspect. The versatile accommodation comprises four bedrooms, three reception rooms, a kitchen/dining area, garage, 2 spacious attic areas, family bathroom, ensuite and guest WC, providing an abundance of living and working space for modern family life.\nInternally, the home is presented with solid craftsmanship and quality finishes throughout, featuring hardwood flooring, attractive tiling and a welcoming wood-burning stove that creates a warm and inviting atmosphere. The kitchen and sunroom are flooded with natural light thanks to their south-west orientation, making them ideal spaces for everyday living and entertaining alike.\nOutside, the property enjoys mature gardens. The extensive grounds offer wonderful potential for further enhancement or extension, should additional accommodation be required in the future.\nPractical features include a tarmac driveway with ample parking to both the front and rear, sensor lighting and a fully alarmed security system, ensuring both convenience and peace of mind.\nThe location is equally impressive, offering the perfect blend of countryside tranquillity and city accessibility. Ballyneety Golf Club is just a five-minute drive away, while Raheen Business Park, University Hospital Limerick and Limerick City are all within easy commuting distance. Families will also appreciate the property's position on a local school bus route, adding further convenience to everyday life.\nCombining generous accommodation, mature grounds and outstanding potential to further update this excellent property, this is a wonderful family home in a sought-after location that offers great potential and exciting opportunities for the future.\nThere is a further opportunity to purchase some additional adjoining land if required. (Subject to agreement)\nAccommodation: Hall, Living room, Kitchen/breakfast room, Sitting room, Office/playroom, Sunroom, utility room, Guest w.c. garage. Four bedrooms, ensuite, family bathroom.\nBER C\nFloor area: 237 square meters/2,551 square feet (approx.)"
